Embedded font
=============

The embedded font file `app/assets/Px437_IBM_VGA_8x16.ttf` is from the
Oldschool PC Font Resource by VileR:

    https://int10h.org/oldschool-pc-fonts/

`app/assets/TurboKodVGA16x32.ttf` is a derivative of it by Anders
Hovmöller: the glyphs redrawn on a 16×32 pixel grid, with the original
8×16 bitmaps embedded unchanged as a 16px bitmap strike.

Both are distributed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0
International License (CC BY-SA 4.0):

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

You are free to share and adapt the font, including for commercial use,
provided you give appropriate credit, link to the license, indicate any
changes, and distribute your contributions under the same license.
